<title>VENEZUELA: TABLE-Ceramica Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ceramica Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr n/a</p>
<p>Net 1.206 billion bolivars vs 1.252 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Sales 12.373 billion bolivars vs 15.533 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Cost of sales 8.014 billion bolivars vs 10.833 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Oper income 2.796 billion bolivars vs 2.874 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Net cost of financing 752.320 million bolivars vs 1.041 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Three month period ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>Results are inflation adjusted.</p>
<p>Ceramica Carabobo manufactures ceramic products for construction.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
